<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pulte cut to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pulte cut to outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has cut its rating on Pulte Corp to outperform from buy, a source at the brokerage said Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Bloomfield Hills, Mich., home builder closed Wednesday at 31-3/4.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
